{"id": "sfo-rent-late-fee-policy", "title": "SFO left $74,407 of calculated lease late charges unassessed", "seconds": 60.8, "voice": "elevenlabs:OUMCzFUTd0F4Q6lkLkco", "narrator": "Roxy", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "3732d0514080c29b", "words": 147, "beats": [{"scene": "terms", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Three Airport lease audits found $74,407 in unassessed late charges.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 7.03, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$74,407", "label": "Calculated late charges"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.46, 0.99, 1.31, 1.76, 2.05, 2.73, 3.3, 3.6, 3.99, 4.36, 4.9, 5.14, 5.79, 6.07]}, {"scene": "terms", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[1]"], "text": "The leases called for extra charges when rent arrived late.", "t0": 7.15, "t1": 10.56, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "avis", "heading": "Lease late charges", "context": "Lease late charges", "layout": "relationship", "rows": [{"icon": "document", "label": "Lease", "value": "Monthly charge"}, {"icon": "calendar", "label": "Monthly charge", "value": "1.5 percent"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.59, 0.92, 1.1, 1.45, 1.98, 2.24, 2.55, 2.99]}, {"scene": "terms", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "Before April 2012, the Airport generally did not collect these charges.", "t0": 10.68, "t1": 15.25, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "hudson", "text": "Airport lease audit", "mark": "lease", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller’s Office"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.47, 0.83, 1.14, 1.57, 1.71, 2.22, 2.71, 2.89, 3.1, 3.53, 3.79]}, {"scene": "avis", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "Avis Budget accounted for $53,843.", "t0": 15.47, "t1": 20.24, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "avis", "heading": "Avis Budget", "context": "Avis Budget", "layout": "amounts", "rows": [{"icon": "receipt", "label": "Late charges", "value": "$53,843"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.42, 0.81, 1.29, 1.47, 2.09, 2.71, 3.01, 3.46, 4.09]}, {"scene": "avis", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[1]"], "text": "Auditors could not verify the underlying rental transactions.", "t0": 20.36, "t1": 23.88, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "avis", "heading": "Rental records", "context": "Avis Budget", "layout": "relationship", "rows": [{"icon": "document", "label": "Reported revenues", "value": "$207,134,383"}, {"icon": "document", "label": "Rental counts", "value": "Insufficient records"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.55, 0.74, 0.91, 1.4, 1.54, 2.14, 2.51]}, {"scene": "credits", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "Hudson News paid its rent. Its calculated late charges were $7,030.", "t0": 24.1, "t1": 30.27, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "hudson", "heading": "Hudson News", "context": "Rent and credits", "layout": "amounts", "rows": [{"icon": "receipt", "label": "Rent", "value": "$2,898,493"}, {"icon": "receipt", "label": "Late charges", "value": "$7,030"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.5, 0.85, 1.14, 1.35, 2.46, 2.74, 3.42, 3.68, 4.18, 4.37, 4.72, 5.17, 5.52]}, {"scene": "credits", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "Hertz accounted for $13,534 in late charges.", "t0": 30.39, "t1": 35.62, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "hertz", "heading": "Hertz", "context": "Rent and credits", "layout": "amounts", "rows": [{"icon": "receipt", "label": "Late charges", "value": "$13,534"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.34, 0.84, 1.02, 1.55, 2.08, 2.44, 2.83, 3.46, 4.0, 4.19, 4.45]}, {"scene": "credits", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "Hertz also overpaid rent. Credit memos corrected that difference.", "t0": 35.74, "t1": 39.68, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "hertz", "heading": "Green-vehicle credits", "context": "Rent and credits", "layout": "amounts", "rows": [{"icon": "receipt", "label": "Rent overpayment", "value": "$439,191"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.4, 0.77, 1.33, 1.87, 2.27, 2.64, 3.09, 3.29]}, {"scene": "change", "kind": "record", "ref